<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">The Design Space of Tri-Modal Masked Diffusion Models</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Louis Bethune
</span></span>
