<span class="ltx_bibblock ltx_bib_cited">Cited by: <a href="#S2.SS1.SSS0.Px2.p1.1" title="Image. ‣ 2.1 Masked Diffusion Models ‣ 2 Background and Related Work ‣ The Design Space of Tri-Modal Masked Diffusion Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">§2.1</span></a>.
</span></li>
