<span class="ltx_bibblock"><span class="ltx_text ltx_bib_author">H. Zheng, S. Gong, R. Zhang, T. Chen, J. Gu, M. Zhou, N. Jaitly, and Y. Zhang</span>
</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock"><span class="ltx_text ltx_bib_title">Continuously augmented discrete diffusion model for categorical generative modeling</span>.
