<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering" style="font-size:90%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 5: </span>Model and training details for the 3B multimodal <span title="Masked Diffusion Models" class="ltx_glossaryref">MDM</span>.</figcaption>
