</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A7.T8.3.11" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A7.T8.3.11.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t">
<span id="A7.T8.3.11.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:338.1pt;">
<span id="A7.T8.3.11.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.T8.3.11.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">(ae)</span> Expanded horse nostrils with rime on facial hairs</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A7.T8.3.12" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A7.T8.3.12.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t">
<span id="A7.T8.3.12.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:338.1pt;">
