<span id="A7.T8.3.13.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.T8.3.13.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">(ag)</span> A black and white illustration of a shaggy dog with pointed ears, wide eyes looking forward, and a slightly open mouth against a white background.</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A7.T8.3.14" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A7.T8.3.14.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t">
