<span id="A7.T8.3.14.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.T8.3.14.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">(ah)</span> A traditional Andalusian white village in Casares, Spain, with tightly packed white buildings and terracotta roofs built along a hillside, surrounded by greenery and lacking modern infrastructure.</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A7.T8.3.15" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A7.T8.3.15.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t">
