<span id="A7.T8.3.15.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.T8.3.15.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">(ai)</span> Watercolor botanical illustrations of a pink lotus and a rose with soft brushstrokes and detailed petals, isolated on a white background in a delicate hand-painted style.</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A7.T8.3.16" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A7.T8.3.16.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t">
