<span id="A7.T8.3.16.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.T8.3.16.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">(aj)</span> A colorful Day of the Dead illustration featuring a skull wearing a sombrero and holding maracas, surrounded by flowers on a clean white background.</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A7.T8.3.17" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A7.T8.3.17.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t">
<span id="A7.T8.3.17.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:338.1pt;">
<span id="A7.T8.3.17.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.T8.3.17.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">(ak)</span> A handshake between two men in suits, one seated at a desk with papers and a pen, the other standing and smiling, with a bookshelf visible behind them.</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A7.T8.3.18" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A7.T8.3.18.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t">
