<span id="A7.T8.3.18.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.T8.3.18.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">(al)</span> Cactus plants with pink flowers in brown pots placed on a wooden table, set against tiled flooring and a brown-and-yellow tiled wall.</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A7.T8.3.19" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A7.T8.3.19.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t">
